# Operator docs

- `README.md` and `docs/HANDOVER-*.md` stay in Chinese. `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/rules/` stay in English. The owner communicates in Chinese.
- Handover files record topology and read-only checks only. Do not add passwords, `PANEL_SECRET`, Reality private keys, SOCKS5 credentials, session cookies, or contents of `state.json` / `config.json`.
- The 2026-11-02 handover was not live-verified over SSH when it was written. Do not treat its commands as permission to run them against production.
- Do not "fix" docs by changing `panel.py`, systemd units, Compose, or the Dockerfile.
